### Step 2: Definition of the Rumen
The **rumen** is the **first--and largest—part of a rumantic animal's alinteral sac**. It is a **large, muscular, pear-shaped container** located in the **intletal cavity** (the part of the body where digestion occurs). It is also known as the **gastatic sac** or **gastatic sac**.

