Thus, the sequence $f(2^n)$ is:
\[
f(2^1) = 1 + \frac{1}{2} = \frac{3}{2}, \quad f(2^2) > 2, \quad f(2^3) > \frac{5}{2}, \quad f(2^4) > 3, \quad f(2^5) > \frac{7}{2}, \ldots
