   - The amplitude is \( 2 \).

3. **Combining the Terms:**
   - The period of the combined function is the least common multiple of the periods of the individual terms. Here, \( \text{LCM}(\pi, \frac{2\pi}{3}) = \frac{6\pi}{3} = 2\pi \).
