   - \(L_{\alpha}\) is the \(L_{\alpha}\) series, a growing sequence of starves with \(L_0 = \text{null}\) and \(L_{\alpha} = \{ t \mid t \text{ is a member of } L_{\beta} \text{ for all } \beta < \alpha\} \).
