Using the lumped parameter method:  
\[
\frac{T - T_a}{T_0 - T_a} = e^{-t/\tau}
\]  
where \( \tau = \frac{m c_p}{h A} \).  

#### (ii) Time required to reach 50°C:  
Using the same equation:  
\[
\frac{50 - 20}{345 - 20} = e^{-t/\tau}
