- Eigenvector 1: \(\mathbf{v}_1 = \begin{bmatrix} 0.331 \\ 0.516 \\ 0.704 \end{bmatrix}\)
- Eigenvector 2: \(\mathbf{v}_2 = \begin{bmatrix} 0.516 \\ -0.331 \\ 0.000 \end{bmatrix}\)
- Eigenvector 3: \(\mathbf{v}_3 = \begin{bmatrix} 0.516 \\ 0.000 \\ -0.331 \end{bmatrix}\)

The orthogonal matrix \([R]\) is:
\[
